"`nx_factory_rtc(NX_RTC_ID_CALENDAR)`. Its pinless software reference Board "
"has unknown PCB identity and does not establish an LSE crystal route. The "
"DMA2D public consumer is an explicit component fixture, without TOML/factory"
" routing."
msgstr ""
"Optional component targets are linked explicitly through "
"`nexus_add_firmware(... LIBRARIES ...)`. They do not create factory entries "
"or discover hardware. RTC uses the maintained "
"[assembly](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/tools/configure/assemblies/u575-rtc-run.toml) and "
"`nx_factory_rtc(NX_RTC_ID_CALENDAR)`. Its pinless software reference Board "
